Collect OpenSSL DLLs of any version for Windows

Purpose: the Windows installer builds again. MSYS2 moved to OpenSSL 4,
whose DLLs are libcrypto-4-x64.dll and libssl-4-x64.dll; the installer
script copied the version 3 names and failed.

Approach: build-aux/inno_build.py collects libcrypto-*-x64.dll and
libssl-*-x64.dll, whatever the major version, and fails with a message
when one of the two is missing.

Constraints: not an overlay feature, a fix to upstream's script. Offer
it upstream; when upstream fixes it, stg rebase reports this patch
empty and it can be deleted.

